{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1166432-m20-equipment-questions","id":1166432,"title":"M20 equipment questions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-12-10T01:13:17-08:00","id":1166432,"title":"M20 equipment questions","content":"Since I'm planning a Technocracy campaign I've been reading a bit more throughly the equipment section of M20 and I am sadly left with a few missing blocks that I hope you guys might help with.<br /> <br /> <u>Caste-Graves WW-3</u>: What kind of weapon is this? It looks like an heavy machine gun but I can't find any description in the manual.<br /> <u>M-79 and M-19 Grenade Launchers</u>: damage value are 400 and 600 (respectively) while ranges are 8 and 2. That kind of damage seems blatantly wrong, especially because it's supposed to depend on the explosive type; range is wrong too, who the hell would ever throw up to 2 meters a 10 meters radius grenade?<br /> So, I suppose that the first value is about range (still very high, even if in line with other military weapons) and the second one is the clip. Am I right?<br /> <u>Hit Mark Chaingun</u>: It's marked not concealable, but isn't that the chaingun hidden into their arm?<br /> <u>Chainmail</u>: Okay, not exactly high tech but since I'm already at it: why has it an higher protection than a steel plate? Shouldn't the values be swapped?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13673-maris-streck","name":"Maris Streck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13673_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-10T01:29:18-08:00","id":1166433,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maris Streck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1166432-m20-equipment-questions#post1166432\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><u>Caste-Graves WW-3</u>: What kind of weapon is this? It looks like an heavy machine gun but I can't find any description in the manual.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Castle-Graves WW-3 is indeed a mystery for now. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> Stats-wise though, it indeed seems like some heavy MG.<br /> <br /> <u><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maris Streck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1166432-m20-equipment-questions#post1166432\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">M-79 and M-19 Grenade Launchers</div> </div> </div> </div></u><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maris Streck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1166432-m20-equipment-questions#post1166432\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">: damage value are 400 and 600 (respectively) while ranges are 8 and 2. That kind of damage seems blatantly wrong, especially because it's supposed to depend on the explosive type; range is wrong too, who the hell would ever throw up to 2 meters a 10 meters radius grenade?<br /> So, I suppose that the first value is about range (still very high, even if in line with other military weapons) and the second one is the clip. Am I right?</div> </div> </div> </div>The M-79 has a damage of 6, the M-19 a damage of 8, range 400 and 500...it looks fine to me in my book, so I have a feeling you're not looking at the post-errata version of the PDF <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Check your drivethru downloads for the Final version. I think I remember that being a layout mistake in the pre-errata version.<br /> <br /> <u><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maris Streck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1166432-m20-equipment-questions#post1166432\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hit Mark Chaingun</div> </div> </div> </div></u><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maris Streck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1166432-m20-equipment-questions#post1166432\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">: It's marked not concealable, but isn't that the chaingun hidden into their arm?</div> </div> </div> </div>Only with an Arete roll...and with an Arete roll and a fitting Paradigm, any weapon is concealable.<br /> The chaingun is quite simply not hidable with any sort of clothing.<br /> <br /> <u><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maris Streck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1166432-m20-equipment-questions#post1166432\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Chainmail</div> </div> </div> </div></u><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maris Streck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1166432-m20-equipment-questions#post1166432\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">: Okay, not exactly high tech but since I'm already at it: why has it an higher protection than a steel plate? Shouldn't the values be swapped?</div> </div> </div> </div>The Steel plate in question covers less than the chainmail - it's a mere 'Steel Breastplate', while I presume the chainmail is the type that hangs well over your hips and down your arms. The full plate has the higher protection than the chainmail as it usually covers just about everything aside of some small parts of the joints, if the full set is strapped on..","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":6606,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","user":"Ambrosia","date":". 12-10-2017, 05:00 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-10T02:04:14-08:00","id":1166435,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maris Streck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1166432-m20-equipment-questions#post1166432\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><u>Caste-Graves WW-3</u>: What kind of weapon is this? It looks like an heavy machine gun but I can't find any description in the manual.</div> </div> </div> </div>Stat wise it seems to be some kind of very modern, improved assault rifle. It has a larger range (200 instead of 150, as the standart assault rifle), greater ammo clips and seems to be about as big (non concealable) with the same abilities (full auto, three round burst and strafing).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13221-thevarulfen","name":"TheVarulfen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}